   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 02: Depth-Sampled MLP Activation Caching\n",
    "### Mechanistic Interpretability of Native MLP Monosemanticity in `google/gemma-4-12B-it`\n",
    "**Gemma 4 Paper Track — Phase 2**\n",
    "\n",
    "[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/baddest-cmd/gemma-clean-code/blob/main/notebooks/02_activation_caching.ipynb)\n",
    "\n",
    "In this phase, we isolate whether intermediate MLP representations in Gemma natively encode Abstract Syntax Tree (AST) constructs before downstream attention mixing.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Experimental Workflow:\n",
    "1. **Depth-Sampling Middle Layers**: Focus on Layers **16**, **24**, and **32** (where high-level syntactical abstractions stabilize without exhausting Colab GPU VRAM).\n",
    "2. **Keyword Offset Hooking**: Forward hooks attached to `blocks.{layer}.mlp.hook_post` capture activations at exact keyword tokens (`try`, `with`, `async`, `class`, `for`).\n",
    "3. **Contrastive Delta Computation**: $\\Delta A = \\mu(A_{\\text{target}}) - \\mu(A_{\\text{control}})$ across 300 contrastive pairs (600 snippets).\n",
    "4. **Monosemantic Selectivity Analysis**: Identify peak variance neurons uniquely activated by target AST constructs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Environment & Repository Setup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "\n",
    "IN_COLAB = \"google.colab\" in sys.modules\n",
    "\n",
    "if IN_COLAB:\n",
    "    print(\"⚡ Running in Google Colab environment.\")\n",
    "    if not os.path.exists(\"gemma-clean-code\"):\n",
    "        !git clone https://github.com/baddest-cmd/gemma-clean-code.git\n",
    "        %cd gemma-clean-code\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        %cd gemma-clean-code\n",
    "        !git pull origin main\n",
    "    !pip install -q -r requirements.txt\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(f\"💻 Running in local workspace: {os.getcwd()}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Ensure project root is in sys.path\n",
    "project_root = os.path.abspath(os.path.join(os.getcwd(), \"..\")) if os.path.basename(os.getcwd()) == \"notebooks\" else os.getcwd()\n",
    "if project_root not in sys.path:\n",
    "    sys.path.insert(0, project_root)\n",
    "print(f\"Project root: {project_root}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Hugging Face Authentication & GPU Verification"
